#~ msgid "How does the override option work in Rules?"
#~ msgstr "Como é que a opção de substituição funciona nas Regras?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "By default, per-product prices take precedence over Rules. Enabling "
#~ "\"Override product level configuration\" inside a Rule forces the Rule to "
#~ "apply even when a per-product price is set, giving Rules higher priority."
